  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems. The type check shows no errors in the changed files, but I didn't run the test suite.\n\n1. **People who never opted in:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now only returns people who chose digest delivery for at least one kind of notification in that workspace. Before, anyone who had changed any setting there was included.\n2. **Oldest updates kept on busy days:** In `buildDigest` (`src/server/services/digest-service.ts`), updates are now sorted newest first before the cap is applied. The digest keeps the most recent updates, and the email's headline is the newest one.\n3. **Archived workspaces still sending:** Both `runDigestEmailJob` (`src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts`) and `buildDigest` now skip archived workspaces, using the existing `isArchived` helper. Live workspaces work as before.",
